<title>USA: PaineWebber settlement approved by judge.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber settlement approved by judge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A federal court judge gave final approval on Thursday to a $200 million settlement in a class action suit against PaineWebber Group Inc.</p>
<p>The settlement involves claims related to the securities firm's sale of risky limited partnerships during the late 1980s and early 1990s.</p>
<p>U.S. District Judge Sidney Stein said the settlement is &quot;fair, reasonable and adequate, and is in the best interests&quot; of the investors.</p>
</text>
